OL,5,G0506 The Newsroom
OL,6,     FThe world's Newsroom brings you
OL,7,     Fglobal events as they happen.
OL,8,G0530 BBC News Summary
OL,9,     FThe latest two minute news summary
OL,10,     Ffrom BBC World Service.
OL,11,G0532 Asia Specific
OL,12,     FChina's ability to scale up and
OL,13,     Flower costs for the masses has
OL,14,     Fnever been disputed. But does
OL,15,     FChina truly create inventions, or
OL,16,     Fdoes it excel at perfecting
OL,17,     Fpre-existing ideas?
